sequenceDiagram
    participant PG as Product grid
    participant NS as NetworkScheduler
    participant OK as OkHttp
    participant BK as Backend
    PG->>NS: schedule(UserVisible, loadImage A) x6 (visible)
    PG->>NS: schedule(Prefetch, loadImage N) x20 (offscreen)
    Note over NS: capacity = 4, admit UserVisible first
    NS->>OK: 4 visible image requests
    OK->>BK: GET images
    BK-->>OK: images
    PG->>NS: user scrolls, cancel offscreen prefetch jobs
    NS-->>NS: slot freed, admit next by priority
    NS->>OK: remaining visible, then surviving prefetch
